(!*********************************************************************
   Mosel Example Problems
   ======================

   file absval.mos
   ```````````````
   Absolute values: formulation of maximize( |x1-2*x2| ) 
   
     Example discussed in section 6.5 of
     J.Kallrath and J.M.Wilson: Business Optimisation Using Mathematical
     Programming, 2nd ed, Springer 2020 

   author: S. Heipcke, June 2018

   (c) Copyright 2020 Fair Isaac Corporation
  
